# Garenbrig Growth {G} (CR 715.3): a land card in your graveyard is as legal a target as a creature card. Turn 1 Bot1's Faithless
# Looting draws two Forests and discards a Mox Sapphire and a Forest; Garenbrig Growth refuses the Mox Sapphire (an artifact card)
# and returns the Forest, so Bot1 holds four Forests again and Virtue of Strength is in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Virtue of Strength
Faithless Looting
Mox Sapphire
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Mox Sapphire; Forest#1)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Forest; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Virtue of Strength.Cast(Ability: Garenbrig Growth; Bot1.Graveyard.Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Hand.Virtue of Strength.Cast(Ability: Garenbrig Growth; Bot1.Graveyard.Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Virtue of Strength
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest
